Usage
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Enter the following command to use the latest template version:

.. code-block:: bash

    pip install "{{ cookiecutter_requirement }}" && cookiecutter https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ tpl_repo }}

To use a specific released version (see the `full list of releases <https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ tpl_repo }}/releases>`_):

.. code-block:: bash

    cookiecutter https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ tpl_repo }} --checkout tags/${version}

For example, to use ``{{ version }}``, the latest version:

.. code-block:: bash

    cookiecutter https://github.com/{{ owner }}/{{ tpl_repo }} --checkout tags/{{ version }}

